      <h2 class="h2">Marketing</h2>
      <p>Marketing your Street Support location is important because it spreads awareness that help is available in your area. It can also help with fundraising, recruiting volunteers and connecting with others who might be able to help.</p>
      <p>Firstly and foremostly, we’d recommend you get in touch with Mara, our Marketing and Communications Lead. She can meet with you and your team to guide you on branding and produce a marketing plan that works for you and your budget (even if that’s non-existent!).</p>
      <p>In the past, this has included working with local media, local businesses and billboard companies. We can also work with you to create social media campaigns and print-out assets tailored to you.</p>

